{
  "type": "architect_batch",
  "projectId": "p7",
  "taskId": "p7-t1",
  "itemId": "w4",
  "detail": "在 backend/src/routes/projects.js 实现项目 CRUD：POST /api/projects（owner=当前 X-User-Id 用户，写库时同步插入 membership 角色 owner，缺 name→400）、GET /api/projects（仅返回公开项目 + 当前用户为成员的私密项目）、GET /api/projects/{id}（返回带 isMember/isOwner，私密且非成员→403）、PUT /api/projects/{id}（仅 owner，否则 403）、DELETE /api/projects/{id}（仅 owner，否则 403，依赖 w2 外键级联清掉 memberships/tasks/tags/task_tag/comments）。认证统一复用 w3 中间件（缺头或指向不存在用户→401），身份只信 X-User-Id 头、忽略 body/query 自称字段。返回体统一 {data}/{error:{message}}，字段 camelCase（isPrivate/ownerUserId/createdAt ISO8601）。可见性与 owner 判定基于 membership 表与 project.ownerUserId 比对，不信任任何客户端入参。",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "ac-10",
      "kind": "CONTRACT",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/projects",
      "expectedStatus": 201,
      "resetPaths": [
        "backend/data/team-tasks.db"
      ],
      "setup": [
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/api/users",
          "body": {
            "name": "OwnerA"
          },
          "expectedStatus": 201,
          "extract": {
            "name": "oid",
            "from": "data.id"
          }
        }
      ],
      "headers": {
        "X-User-Id": "{oid}"
      },
      "body": {
        "name": "Proj A",
        "description": "hello",
        "isPrivate": false
      },
      "assertJson": [
        {
          "path": "data.name",
          "equals": "Proj A"
        },
        {
          "path": "data.isPrivate",
          "equals": false
        },
        {
          "path": "data.ownerUserId",
          "exists": true
        },
        {
          "path": "data.id",
          "exists": true
        }
      ],
      "expected": "创建项目成功，owner 取当前身份并自动成成员"
    },
    {
